================================================================================
 data/MANIFEST — deposit checklist for microRNA-abalone-acidification
================================================================================
Purpose: single source of truth for WHERE every data object lives and what
uses it. Four tiers:
  [REPO]   already in this repo's data/ (small; ships with the code)
  [ZENODO] large / raw -> upload to the Zenodo release, then cite the DOI
  [FAIR]   public/community resource or regenerable -> NOT deposited (fetch from source)
  [SRA]    already public in the NCBI Sequence Read Archive

Sizes are the current on-disk sizes (2026-09-11). Check a box when uploaded.
Zenodo record should also contain: this repo's tagged release (GitHub->Zenodo),
the README, and the raw water-chemistry + respirometry measurements.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

