        source: https://metazoa.ensembl.org/info/data/ftp/  (process with seqkit)
  - STRING v12.0 protein.links.full.v12.0.txt + protein.info.v12.0.txt
        source: https://string-db.org/cgi/download  (process with 04_annotation_go/3_STRING-db.R)
