  - org.Hs.eg.db (GOSemSim data for topGO)  -> Bioconductor
  - Regenerable intermediates: SEQUENCES_MERGED_DDS_DESEQ2.rds, SRNA_FUNCTION_PREDICTED_LONG_EXPRESSED.rds,
