Notes
 - "core" = needed to re-run the R modules from data/ without regenerating from raw reads.
 - "raw/optional" = large upstream products; include for full reproducibility but the
   figures/tables reproduce from the "core" set alone. Gzip the big text/gff/gtf files.
 - After the Zenodo release: paste the DOI into README (badge + section 1) and into the
   manuscript's Data/Code Availability statements, and set the repo URL to
   https://github.com/RJEGR/microRNA-abalone-acidification
